{"id":"00181","root":"uni00181_1","name":{"ja":"水城　ゆきかぜ","en":"Mizuki Yukikaze"},"title":{"ja":"【雷撃の新学期】","en":"【Lightning's New Semester】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【雷撃の新学期】 水城　ゆきかぜ","en":"【Lightning's New Semester】 Mizuki Yukikaze"},"aliases":["Demon Yukikaze"],"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-04-15","limited":false,"characterId":12,"profile":{"ja":"新世代の戦力と期待される若き対魔忍。代々、“雷遁の術”使いを輩出する名門で彼女も亡き父親同様、“雷遁の術”を使う。“雷遁の術”とは雷を操る強力な術で攻撃系忍法では最強の火力と言われているもの。その中でも彼女の操る雷撃は強力すぎて制御が難しいため、術を行使する触媒として特別に制作された銃を使用している。ゆきかぜはその銃に雷撃の弾丸を生み出し、強力な雷撃弾を発射する事ができる。二丁拳銃を得物に、舞うように雷撃弾を放つその姿から“雷撃の対魔忍”の異名を持つ。勝気で負けず嫌い、プライドの高さがたまにキズで唯一心許せる存在の幼馴染の秋山達郎となかなか恋愛関係に進展できないのが悩み。とにかく体を動かして遊ぶのが好きで年中日焼けしている美少女。","en":"Mizuki Yukikaze is a young Taimanin hailed as the next-generation powerhouse. She hails from a prestigious line that has produced generations of \"Lightning-Style\" practitioners, and like her late father, she wields the \"Lightning-Style\"—a formidable art that commands thunder and is famed as the most destructive offensive ninjutsu. Because her lightning strikes are so potent they're hard to control, she employs a specially crafted gun as a catalyst for the technique. Mizuki generates lightning-charged bullets in the gun and can fire devastating thunderbolts. Armed with a pair of pistols, she dances across the battlefield unleashing lightning rounds, earning her the moniker \"Lightning-Strike Taimanin.\" She's headstrong, hates losing, and her lofty pride is her only soft spot, making it difficult for her to advance a romance with her childhood friend Akiyama Tatsuro. She loves to stay active, is constantly sun-kissed, and is a beautiful girl who never stops moving."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"氷室百合","forms":[{"id":"uni00181_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1164,2328],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[165,330],"def":[145,290],"spd":[67,67],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["4","160004"]},{"id":"uni00181_2",